        "jsCode": "// Stop the retry loop if Fireflies still has no summary after MAX_RETRIES checks.\nconst MAX_RETRIES = 10;\nif ($runIndex >= MAX_RETRIES) {\n  throw new Error(`Fireflies summary not ready after ${MAX_RETRIES} checks. Stopping.`);\n}\nreturn $input.all();"
